    },
    {
      "Id": 101220090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "That's great!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Where are you right now, Sensei?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220110,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "Can I drop by in a bit?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Do you also have something like that?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "You know,"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "like, an unexpected side of you"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220160,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "A side of you"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "that not even you know about"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220180,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Perhaps?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220190,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Probably."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Heh"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I see"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220220,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "So even an adult like you..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Fufu."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm relieved!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "And veeery curious about these different sides of you. ♪"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220260,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Senseiii"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220270,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "What'cha doing?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220280,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Nothing really"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220290,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Wow"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220300,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I see"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220310,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Would you like to join me, Mika?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220320,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220330,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Yes yes YES!!!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220340,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Heehee"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220350,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220360,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Of all the classes I've taken lately,"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220370,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "today's was the most fun."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220380,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I wouldn't exactly call that a \"class\"..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220390,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Heehee"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220400,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Let's do it again sometime. ☆"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220410,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220420,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220430,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "There are lots more pretty things in the ocean"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220440,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "than you'd expect"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220450,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Like what?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220460,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Um"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220470,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Misono Mika?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220480,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ahaha, just kidding ☆"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220490,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I can totally see the face you're making in my head"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Well, for example"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "clams and conch shells"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "seni"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220530,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "he"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220540,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Mika...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220550,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "jus"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220560,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "a"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220570,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "^&t"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220590,
      "Speaker": "Student",
