      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Hm? Not particularly..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220820,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "No"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220830,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm sure you're hungry"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220840,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "You're hungry, right?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101220850,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm suddenly starting to get hungry, I think?"
